        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>住宿建议 - 选酒店关注点</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fdfbf6;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    max-width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 28px 60px 28px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background-color: #fdfbf6;\n    background-image:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.012) 0 1px, transparent 1px 4px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.012) 0 1px, transparent 1px 4px);\n  }\n  h1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    margin: 20px 0 34px 0;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    margin: 0 0 46px 0;\n  }\n  .u-red {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #d94a4a;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .u-wave {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #d94a4a;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .tag span.name {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #d94a4a;\n  }\n  p.item {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 2.05;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1>住宿<span class=\"u-red\">建议</span></h1>\n\n  <h2>［选酒店关注点］</h2>\n\n  <p class=\"item\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">【<span class=\"name\">沙滩</span>】</span>：亲子家庭出行游，<span class=\"u-red\">对沙滩的质量和海水的选择上要干净、清澈</span>，<span class=\"u-red\">沙子细软不扎脚的</span>。有私人海滩更佳\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"item\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">【<span class=\"name\">酒店设施</span>】</span>：针对酒店的洗护<span class=\"u-red\">有没有提供宝宝专用</span>，以及宝宝专用的洗漱台和马桶等等，以及<span class=\"u-red\">有没有婴儿床、床围</span>等床上用品提供\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"item\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">【<span class=\"name\">房间</span>】</span>：房间主题最好有小朋友喜欢的主题，比如<span class=\"u-red\">太空主题</span>的房间或者星空主题的房间；以及房间有没有提供儿童帐篷、滑梯等玩乐设施。<span class=\"u-red\">房型面积最好大一些</span>，<span class=\"u-red\">有足够的空间给小朋友跑跳玩乐</span>\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"item\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">【<span class=\"name\">儿童玩乐设施</span>】</span>：看酒店儿童玩乐设施<span class=\"u-red\">室内还是室外</span>.设施是不是<span class=\"u-red\">每日一消毒</span>，看空间宽不宽敞。有没有家长休息区。有没有<span class=\"u-red\">托管服务</span>，托管时间，托管玩的项目等具体小朋友玩乐细节\n  </p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
